| ADR-006: Terminal integration | tmux for presentation | Remote/web client becomes a requirement |
| ADR-007: Retry strategy | Bounded stage retries; operator-led remediation first | Automated repair loops have reliable safeguards |
| ADR-008: Extensibility | Local workflow/Skill catalog | Internal private marketplace integration is stable |

